Leave the Hermes host out of the host pickers.

Hermes sessions start on the deployment's always-on Hermes host by
themselves (server patch 0024-hermes-host.patch), and the host runs nothing
else. GET /v1/hosts marks it hermes_only, and the host list every picker uses
leaves it out, as it does sandbox hosts. The list that labels a session's own
host keeps it, so a Hermes session's composer shows its host by name.
Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d), after 0039-agent-progress.patch.
diff --git a/web/src/hooks/useHosts.hermes.test.tsx b/web/src/hooks/useHosts.hermes.test.tsx
